title: loadPhase2
---
<<declare $hasTalkedto to false>>
<<if $acceptedQuest== true>>
<<jump node1>>
<<elseif $finished == true>>
<<jump node3>>
<<else>>
<<jump start2>>
<<endif>>
===
title: start2
---
<<if $acceptedQuest == true>>
<<jump node1>>
<<endif>>
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_RIG "npc">>
COWORKER: HEY! 
COWORKER: Your break is over! The boss has been looking for you!
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_RIG "pc">>
    -> Why
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_RIG "npc">>
        COWORKER: Who knows! But you should probably head inside and ask.
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_RIG "return">>
===
title: node1
---
<<if $finished == true>>
<<jump node3>>
<<endif>>
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_RIG "npc">>
COWORKER: HEY! 
COWORKER: Your break is over! The boss has been looking for you!
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_RIG "pc">>
    -> Why
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_RIG "npc">>
        COWORKER: Who knows! But you should probably head inside and ask.
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_RIG "return">>
    -> Have you seen any apples?
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_RIG "npc">>
        COWORKER: <color=red>Apples? </color> Um I think I saw a crate of some nearby...
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_RIG "return">>
